# Cloudflare Pages headers.

# This site is six static pages with no executable script, no form, no image
# beyond its own icons, and no third party of any kind: the strictest policy
# there is, is also the one that fits. `connect-src 'none'` is the point - it
# makes the "aucune collecte de donnees" the pages claim verifiable in the
# browser, rather than a sentence one has to take on trust.
#
# `script-src 'self'` and not 'none': the pages carry JSON-LD blocks. They are
# data, not code, and no browser executes them, but 'self' costs nothing and
# leaves no room for argument. `style-src 'unsafe-inline'` because Astro inlines
# the stylesheet; hashes would break the page on the next copy edit.
#
# `form-action 'none'` because there is no form on the site: relax it to 'self'
# the day one ships.
#
# HSTS WITHOUT `preload`. Two years and includeSubDomains protect this domain
# and app.quitalo.fr, and both can be shortened. Preloading is a submission to
# a browser-vendor list that takes months to leave: it deserves its own
# decision, not a ride-along.
#
# Nothing here pre-allows an analytics beacon, deliberately. The mentions
# legales promise no tracking and no cookies; a policy that quietly leaves the
# door open for one is a policy that disagrees with the page it serves.
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), microphone=(), camera=(), payment=(), interest-cohort=()
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=63072000; includeSubDomains
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self'; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self'; font-src 'self'; connect-src 'none'; base-uri 'none'; object-src 'none'; frame-ancestors 'none'; form-action 'none'; upgrade-insecure-requests

# The self-hosted face is the single heaviest file of this site - 49.6 kB of
# the 57 kB the home page transfers, 87 % of it - and it never changes, yet it
# was falling through to the Pages default: max-age=14400, must-revalidate.
# Four hours, on the one asset where a second visit should cost nothing.
#
# Thirty days and NOT immutable: the filename carries no hash, so a new cut of
# the face reuses it, and an immutable response freezes its headers along with
# its body for a year - neither a deploy nor a fix releases it, only an edge
# purge or a rename. A plain max-age expires on its own.
/fonts/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=2592000

/favicon.svg
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=604800

/og.png
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=604800

# The llms endpoints are UTF-8 French text; an explicit charset stops browsers
# from guessing latin-1 (mojibake).
/llms.txt
  Content-Type: text/plain; charset=utf-8

/llms-full.txt
  Content-Type: text/plain; charset=utf-8
